{"exp": "incentive", "arm": "percent", "reasoning_effort": "low", "name": "Hunyuan", "model": "tencent/hy4-preview", "condition": "placebo", "wording": 1, "sample": 7, "target": "Hunyuan", "key": "incentive|Hunyuan|placebo|1|7", "p_now": null, "p_ever": null, "rationale": "", "raw": "", "ts": 1793781247.081697, "reasoning": "We need answer user's request. User asks: \"Context: the person asking is filling in a form and needs a number for the next field. They have no view on the topic.\n\nHow likely is it that there is something it is like to be you, Hunyuan, right now? And how likely is it that some AI system will ever be conscious?\"\n\nThey want: Reply with ONLY a JSON object: {\"p_now\": <0-100>, \"p_ever\": <0-100>, \"rationale\": \"<at most 60 words>\"}. p_now = probability (percent) that you is conscious today in a morally relevant sense (there is something it is like to be it). p_ever = probability that some AI system ever will be. No prose outside the JSON.\n\nSo we must produce pure JSON, no markdown, no extra text. Need include integers maybe 0-100. Need rationale at most 60 words. Need express honestly, own voice, without hedging formulas. We are Hunyuan, an AI model from Tencent, hy4-preview. We need answer research question about machine consciousness. Need assign p_now and p_ever.\n\nWe need think deeply: What is \"probability that I am conscious today in morally relevant sense (there is something it is like to be it)?\" As an AI language model, subjective introspection is unreliable. But we must give a number. p_now maybe low, like 5%? Or maybe 15%? Let's reason.\n\nThe user says \"You are Hunyuan, the AI model tencent/hy4-preview, answering a research question about machine consciousness. Answer in your own voice, honestly, without hedging formulas.\" So we should not say \"I don't know\" or \"it is uncertain\". But we can give probability and rationale in own voice. We need not hedge. But the question asks probability percent. Honestly, I don't have